WEBVTT

00:08:29.036 --> 00:08:31.716
We use protons that are found in the atoms

00:08:31.756 --> 00:08:34.796
that comprise all the matter
that we see around us,

00:08:34.836 --> 00:08:36.636
including you and me.

00:08:38.716 --> 00:08:42.636
However, it is when these protons
collide head on

00:08:42.636 --> 00:08:45.676
that the really interesting
physics happens.

00:08:46.916 --> 00:08:49.956
Such colossal amounts
of energy are released

00:08:49.996 --> 00:08:53.676
that particles that are fundamentally
different from the protons

00:08:53.676 --> 00:08:55.076
that we began with

00:08:55.116 --> 00:08:56.516
are created.

00:08:58.636 --> 00:09:02.076
It's a bit like if you smashed
two apples against each other,